{
    "test_name": "MOB.621_Collector_Photo_Add",
    "details": {
        "name": "MOB.621_Collector_Photo_Add",
        "type": "browser",
        "status": "paused",
        "message": "`MOB.621` **A photo really reaches the carousel \u2014 without submitting.**\n- \u2b50 **Settles whether a `bucketKey` is PORTABLE between tests.** `dd_reference/README.md`\n  says it is not, but that is an inference from the path shape, never measured \u2014 and it\n  decides whether upload coverage can be written for any screen or whether every upload\n  test needs a hand-authored step (trap 12). This reuses `MOB.600`'s key from a **different\n  test**. If it fails at the upload step, the README was right.\n- \u2b50 **Covers the two branches `MOB.620` cannot reach**: the carousel only exists once a\n  photo does (`{photos.length > 0 && \u2026}` \u2014 there is no empty state), and the button flips\n  `Add Asset Photo` \u2192 **`Add More Photos`**. `MOB.620` proves the zero side; together they\n  pin the conditional rather than one state of it.\n- \ud83d\uded1 **READ-ONLY, measured not assumed**: `ADD_PHOTO` dispatches to a **local reducer**\n  (`Form/index.tsx:162-165`); the attachment is created by `createAsset` on **submit**. This\n  test never submits, so no asset and no attachment are written. **Do not make it submit** \u2014\n  that is `MOB.600`'s job, and its residue is already accounted for.\n- The upload steps are **read out of `MOB.600`'s JSON at build time**, so there is one copy\n  of the only working recipe; if MOB.600 loses them this build fails loudly.",
        "tags": [
            "Mobile",
            "env:dev",
            "Asset Collector",
            "Photos",
            "read-only"
        ],
        "locations": [
            "gcp:us-west2"
        ],
        "config": {
            "assertions": [],
            "config_variables": [
                {
                    "id": "fe7958bf-435f-4932-af8e-0931caab79e7",
                    "name": "MOBDEV",
                    "type": "global"
                }
            ],
            "request": {
                "headers": {},
                "method": "GET",
                "url": "{{ MOBDEV }}"
            },
            "variables": [
                {
                    "id": "fe7958bf-435f-4932-af8e-0931caab79e7",
                    "name": "MOBDEV",
                    "type": "global"
                }
            ],
            "set_cookie": ""
        },
        "options": {
            "device_ids": [
                "chrome.tablet"
            ],
            "disable_cors": false,
            "disable_csp": false,
            "ignore_server_certificate_error": false,
            "min_failure_duration": 0,
            "min_location_failed": 1,
            "monitor_options": {},
            "no_screenshot": false,
            "retry": {
                "count": 1,
                "interval": 300.0
            },
            "rum_settings": {
                "is_enabled": false
            },
            "tick_every": 86400
        },
        "steps": [
